'''Ghostblade''' is a [[Godly Weapons|godly]] knife that was originally obtainable by purchasing the [[Ghostly Item Pack]] for 1,699 Robux during the [[Halloween Event 2019|2019 Halloween Event]]. It is now only obtainable through [[trading]] as the event has since ended.

==Appearance ==
Ghostblade has a light teal, unique, blade with ridges around the blade. The blade isn't like the default knife, it has a crescent like shape as it's blade, while the guard of it is a grey pebble like stone. The handle of ghost blade is navy blue with another grey pebble like stone on the bottom. It ends with a teal like barb shape on the bottom.

==Trivia==
*It was a victim of the [[The Duping Glitch (2022)|Duping Glitch (2022)]].
*It was designed by [[IDontHaveAUse]].

